Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.45,0:02:19.21,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}神机妙算的战略
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.21,0:02:20.83,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}勇士与懦夫的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.83,0:02:22.46,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}奏响破绽的序曲(Overture)
