Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.49,0:02:56.99,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}弱小的棋子啊 舞动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.87,0:02:58.79,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Zugzwang Du-Ra-ta-ta
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.79,0:03:02.58,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}在我的掌心上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:02.42,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Zugzwang Du-Ra-ta-ta
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:06.09,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}直面黑白交锋 爬向前方
